use firn/tags

nerd-fonts is a Module
nerd-fonts is tagged doom-emacs
nerd-fonts is tagged theming

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.nerd-fonts.enable
    "fonts"
      "packages": [pkgs.nerd-fonts.symbols-only]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."nerd-fonts"."enable": enable "Nerd Fonts symbols"
